        {
          "text": "Nkabela bapati boonse bamunzi oyo uuli kufwaafwi kumuntu uujayidwe baleelede kusanzya maanza aabo atala lyacitole cikoswedwe mutwe oko kukalonga, ",
          "type": "text",
