        {
          "text": "Na muntu ulikwete banakazi bobile, umwi kayandwa, umwi kasulidwe, nkabela bamuzyalila bana, uuyandwa auusulidwe boonse, alimwi mwana mutaanzi nguwayooyo uusulidwe, ",
